            "pricing.cmp1Body": "eber DOM xoqid Wuxuu si caadi ah uga shaqeeyaa Google Meet oo dhan Chrome, Edge, Safari, Firefox, Mac, Windows, iyo Chromebooks iyada oo aan la rakibin kordhinta browserka.",
