            "pricing.cmp4Title": "1-guji CSV & Liisaska Fasalka",
            "pricing.cmp6Body": "Ma jiro rukunsasho qasab ah oo lagu bilaabayo - shaqsigu wuxuu iibsan karaa Pass Lifetime $ 9.99 oo aan dib dambe u bixin. Dugsiyadu waxay bixiyaan hal qiime oo siman dhammaan domainka ($59/sanadka Waaxda, $149/machadka sanadka) halkii ay ka bixin lahaayeen $80-$100 macalinkii meel kale.",
            "pricing.cmp3Body": "Weligaa ha ka welwelin inaad illowdo inaad gujiso dhoofinta. Pro wuxuu si toos ah ugu kaydiyaa xaashida imaanshaha Google Drive kaaga wakhtiga fasalka la soo gabagabeeyo.",
            "pricing.cmp2Body": "Si otomaatig ah ayuu ula socdaa taxanaha fasalka ee soo noqnoqda hal xaashi Google midaysan oo wadata qiimayaasha xaadiritaanka arday kasta simistarka oo dhan.",
            "pricing.cmp5Body": "Turjumaada asalka ah ee 30 luqadood - oo ay ku jiraan Isbaanish, Boortaqiis, Hindi, Tagalog, Indonesian, Fiyatnaamiis, Carabi, Faransiis, Jarmal, Jabbaan, Kuuriyaan, Shiinees, Ruush, Turki, iyo in ka badan.",
            "pricing.cmp4Body": "Ku dheji liisaska ardayda fasalka (ama ka soo deji fasalka Google), deji heerarka imaanshaha, la soco Present vs Late vs Maqan, oo soo deji CSV degdeg ah ama warbixinnada buugga fasalka Moodle/Canvas.",
